    "rule": "a valid /vla/action_4d message ticks at once unless the previous tick started under min_gap_s ago (then at the first poll past it: deferred); with no message the poll ticks period_s after a timer tick, period_s + slack_s after a message's tick; a message received before the mission clock starts is held (the backlog of the node's start-up work is delivered before it), the first one after the start ticks at once, and the first watchdog waits period_s + slack_s when one came within period_s before the start",
