    "p50": null,
    "p95": null,
    "p99": null,
    "max": null,
    "clocks": "camera_age_ms = decision_age_s (the VLA bridge's monotonic clock: its now - t_capture at publication; t_capture the front frame's header stamp mapped onto that clock when the stamp is on the bridge host's wall clock, else the frame's arrival) + this node's monotonic clock from the message's receipt to the setpoint's publication. Two durations on one clock each, no cross-clock subtraction. Not counted: the DDS hop bridge -> this node, and the camera driver's delay before its stamp: a lower bound by that hop",
    "why": "no camera behind the actions: the pilot sent the grant's four values only (the stub, or no pilot), so there is no frame age to report - not a zero"
  },
